{"name":"race_greyish","seed":777,"config":{"rivalsByCount":true}}
# A grey run (phase F step 6a): New Expedition seed 777, the Race row
# stepped three times to the greys. A ship run: the dashboard opens adrift
# with the greys' crew of three aboard (a worker, a technician, a soldier),
# no tutorial. Aboard, the vat and the console stand by the hold; a click on
# the vat opens the crafting modal (the print rows), on the console the
# research modal (the grey tree). The ship travels to the start system and
# the three beam down; the HUD is the greys' (metal, crystal, alloy,
# plastic, specimens; no Sleep order) and the crew stands after 600 ticks.
# A locker placed aboard (debug place) is a door onto the ship's pocket:
# its inspector lists the hold's alloy (phase F step 6b). The console's
# research modal carries the Hull section (deck 1 at radius 8, the next
# ring 10); Expand Hull clicked on deck 1 starts the work: 3000 ticks on,
# the old rim is breached and the new ring's floor is spreading (step 6d).
# Frames: the race row, adrift, the ship with its modules, the vat, the
# console, the site, the site after 600 ticks.
{"op":"wait","ticks":10}
{"op":"click","target":"title:new"}
{"op":"click","target":"title:name"}
